      "text": "If Mala executes the power of attorney while abroad, Section 2 of the Powers of Attorney Ordinance (as amended by Section 2 of the Powers of Attorney (Amendment) Act, No. 3 of 2024) allows a power of attorney to be executed before or attested by an Ambassador, High Commissioner, or other diplomatic representative of Sri Lanka.",
